{"version":"v1.0","updateComponents":{"surfaceId":"stay-services","components":[{"id":"root","component":"Card","elevation":"1","children":["hdr","content"]},{"id":"hdr","component":"CardHeader","children":["title"]},{"id":"title","component":"Text","text":"Add to your stay","variant":"h4"},{"id":"content","component":"CardContent","children":["col"]},{"id":"col","component":"Column","gap":"md","children":["spaTitle","spaList","tourTitle","tourList","otherTitle","otherList","note"]},{"id":"spaTitle","component":"Text","text":"Spa (09:00–20:00)","variant":"h5"},{"id":"spaList","component":"DescriptionList","rows":[{"label":"Swedish massage, 60 min","value":"€120"},{"label":"Deep-tissue massage, 60 min","value":"€135"},{"label":"Hot-stone massage, 90 min","value":"€170"},{"label":"Sea-salt and lemon body scrub, 45 min","value":"€95"},{"label":"Hydrating facial, 50 min","value":"€110"},{"label":"Couples massage, 60 min","value":"€230 for two"}]},{"id":"tourTitle","component":"Text","text":"Tours","variant":"h5"},{"id":"tourList","component":"DescriptionList","rows":[{"label":"Old Town walking tour","value":"Daily at 10:00 from the lobby"},{"label":"Harbor cruise","value":"Daily at 17:00"},{"label":"Half-day coastal boat tour","value":"Tuesday, Thursday and Saturday"}]},{"id":"otherTitle","component":"Text","text":"Dining and extras","variant":"h5"},{"id":"otherList","component":"DescriptionList","rows":[{"label":"Vela","value":"Fine dining, table reservations"},{"label":"Quay Bar","value":"Casual dining and drinks"},{"label":"Late check-out","value":"Until 14:00, subject to availability"}]},{"id":"note","component":"Text","variant":"caption","text":"Spa treatments should be booked at least a day ahead in season."}]}}","codes":["BOOKING_CONFIRMATION_MISSING","PRODUCT_CARD_MISSING"],"detail":"Round 2 failed:
  BOOKING_CONFIRMATION_MISSING: at stay-services:note (stay-services hand-builds confirm a completed booking with note (a Text). Make it ONE BookingConfirmation in place of the hand-built Card, never inside one: resend the Card's id as the BookingConfirmation (a root Card needs the surface re-created and its data model sent again), with its title, data bound to the booking object, and rows as a literal array of {label, path} where each path is a key of that object (never bind rows itself); drop the hand-built rows.)
  PRODUCT_CARD_MISSING: at stay-services:spaList (stay-services hand-builds one product, room or offer to buy or book with spaList (a DescriptionList). Make it ONE ProductCard per item, templated in a Grid over the list in the data model (title, price, the duration or unit as priceNote, and one action with the item id in its context), and drop the hand-built priced rows.)"}}}
